# Generated — never hand-edit, never reformat
pnpm-lock.yaml
# packages/api-client/src/schema.d.ts is regenerated from apps/api/openapi.yaml by
# `pnpm --filter @schoolhub/api-client generate`, and frontend.yml diffs it byte-for-byte
# in the "API types match the committed schema" gate. Reformatting it here would make
# that gate fail on every PR that doesn't also run the generator with this exact
# Prettier config — never touch it.
packages/api-client/src/schema.d.ts

# Python — ruff owns formatting there, not Prettier
apps/api/

# Infra — Terraform, compose, shell; a different domain with its own tooling and no
# Prettier-formatting expectation anywhere in CI. Formatting scripts moved to
# `prettier --write .` (letting this ignore file be the single source of truth for
# what Prettier touches, rather than a hand-synced glob) would otherwise start
# reformatting docker-compose.yml into a much more sprawling multi-line style —
# a real, unreviewed change this PR never intended to make.
infra/

# Docs: hand-tuned tables and mermaid diagrams that Prettier's markdown formatter
# would reflow. Deliberately out of scope for this pass — see AGENTS.md.
**/*.md
